{"title": "Seven killed in multi-storey Delhi hostel collapse; rescue efforts ongoing", "summary": "A multi-storey hostel in Delhi collapsed, resulting in the deaths of seven people. Twelve individuals were rescued from the debris. The National Disaster Response Force (NDRF) stated that the exact number of people trapped inside the collapsed structure is not yet known. Rescue operations are continuing at the site.", "summary_points": ["Seven people have died following the collapse of a multi-storey hostel in Delhi.", "Twelve individuals have been rescued from the site of the collapse.", "The NDRF has indicated that the precise number of individuals trapped is unconfirmed.", "Rescue operations are actively underway at the collapsed hostel."], "title_hi": "दिल्ली में बहुमंजिला हॉस्टल ढहने से सात की मौत; बचाव कार्य जारी", "summary_hi": "दिल्ली में एक बहुमंजिला हॉस्टल ढह गया, जिसमें सात लोगों की मौत हो गई। मलबे से बारह लोगों को बचाया गया। राष्ट्रीय आपदा प्रतिक्रिया बल (एनडीआरएफ) ने कहा कि ढही हुई संरचना के अंदर फंसे लोगों की सटीक संख्या अभी ज्ञात नहीं है। घटनास्थल पर बचाव अभियान जारी हैं।", "summary_points_hi": ["दिल्ली में एक बहुमंजिला हॉस्टल ढहने के बाद सात लोगों की मौत हो गई है।", "मलबे से बारह लोगों को बचाया गया है।", "एनडीआरएफ ने संकेत दिया है कि फंसे हुए लोगों की सटीक संख्या की पुष्टि नहीं हुई है।", "ढहे हुए हॉस्टल में बचाव अभियान सक्रिय रूप से चल रहे हैं।"], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasized the personal tragedy, including the donation of corneas by the family of an 18-year-old victim.", "Highlighted the SOS video calls made by trapped students."], "center": ["Emphasized the death toll and the ongoing rescue efforts, noting the uncertainty about the exact number of trapped individuals."], "right": ["Highlighted a trapped student's SOS video call from under the collapsed hostel, focusing on the human element of the tragedy."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["18 वर्षीय पीड़ित के परिवार द्वारा कॉर्निया दान करने सहित व्यक्तिगत त्रासदी पर जोर दिया।", "फंसे हुए छात्रों द्वारा किए गए एसओएस वीडियो कॉल को उजागर किया।"], "center": ["मृतकों की संख्या और चल रहे बचाव प्रयासों पर जोर दिया, फंसे हुए लोगों की सटीक संख्या के बारे में अनिश्चितता का उल्लेख किया।"], "right": ["ढह गए हॉस्टल के नीचे से फंसे एक छात्र के एसओएस वीडियो कॉल पर प्रकाश डाला, जो त्रासदी के मानवीय पहलू पर केंद्रित था।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.tribuneindia.com/sortd-service/imaginary/v22-01/jpg/large/high?url=dGhldHJpYnVuZS1zb3J0ZC1wcm8tcHJvZC1zb3J0ZC9tZWRpYTNhMzkzYWYwLWFiMTgtMTFmMS05YjIwLTgzZThkYzhhYjE2YS5qcGc=", "sources": [{"source": "India Today", "owner": "India Today Group", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTFBtZVpubW9pNXc3T3duczhtVEVfeEJRcElPYXZvVXhQS1dSNGVfc1JMaThLWG8zSjUyMkRjNVBTUVVLNUtZZWpEWmRFYWQ3YkMwN205ZE5jQlpHWjRZaUdnYzRGQ25QVnVDd21RR20tOA?oc=5", "headline": "Trapped student’s SOS video call shows him under collapsed Delhi PG hostel"}, {"source": "The New Indian Express", "owner": "The New Indian Express", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5", "headline": "7 killed after multi- storey hostel collapses in Delhi; 12 rescued as NDRF says exact number of trapped not known"}, {"source": "Outlook India", "owner": "Outlook India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Family Donates Corneas Of 18-Year-Old Arpit Jai Who Died In Delhi's Satya Niketan PG Collapse"}, {"source": "The Statesman", "owner": "The Statesman", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "New safety policy for buildings used for public activities soon: Delhi CM"}, {"source": "Times Now", "owner": "Times Now", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "DU’s Sri Venkateswara College Closed After Building Collapse, Offers Food, Shelter; Other Colleges Step In"}, {"source": "Euronews", "owner": "E